<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS reduced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst James Barlage reduced the earnings estimate for Intel Corp to $8.30 per share from $8.90 for 1997, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- kept the 1998 estimate at $11, and repeated a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares continued their sharp decline, off 17-57/64 to 145-7/8 in heavy volume.</p>
<p>-- company issued a warning about second quarter results earlier Friday.</p>
</text>
